# Findings that cannot be fixed by a dependency update in this repo.
# Each entry says why; remove it once the blocker is gone.

# @angular/common and @angular/core 16.1.1. The fixes start at 19.2.x / 20.3.28, but
# @airgap/angular-core and @airgap/angular-ngrx declare @angular/* ^16.1.0 as peers, so the
# Angular upgrade has to start with a new angular-core release built against Angular 20+.
