# @stablelib/ed25519 1.0.3 (via @taquito/utils, CJS). Fixed only in 2.1.0, which is ESM-only, so the 1.x copy
# cannot be overridden. The 2.x copies (beacon) are overridden to 2.1.0 in package.json. Note: @airgap/tezos
# signs with the copy vendored in coinlib-core (dependencies/src/@stablelib/ed25519-1.0.3), which trivy cannot
# see; the S < L check has to be ported there.
GHSA-x3ff-w252-2g7j

# elliptic 6.6.1 is the latest release. No fixed version published.
CVE-2025-14505

# decode-uri-component 0.2.2 (via query-string in @walletconnect/client 1.x and @walletconnect/utils 2.x).
# The only fix is 0.5.0, which is ESM-only; query-string 5/6/7 require() it and would break.
CVE-2026-45822
